#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/point_of_sale/static/src/app/utils/init_lna.js:0
msgid "Local Network Access configuration is enabled, but your browser is not Chromium-based. Please use a Chromium-based browser to benefit from this feature. Please note that IOS devices do not support Local Network Access yet."
